    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d843">

                <pb facs="0840" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg526"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador In Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1914-12-14T21:00:00+01:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">December 14, 1914, 9 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>114. Cannot assurances be obtained from England and France that purely commercial
                    cables to America will not be held up? Italy has asked our aid regarding this
                    matter. Complaints are made from a good source. American trade greatly
                    suffering.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Ambassador</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
